<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">By the time you=E2=80=99re reading this, <=
a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc=
_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPg4Po31vrjVzXiEA_Xskplj7xNf=
