g/h28/h001.OcQWx8RZhj7pdKYojmGczDEtY5FQnCgaZG083wDztLU" style=3D"color: #00=
77B6;">Michael Carrick will probably have been sacked</a>. If not, it will =
happen soon enough. Who to blame? The people have spoken. Acknowledging sup=
porters after Manchester United did their usual and got <a href=3D"https://=
ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEM=
