EMkzbEKW5hFsVhYpyq9vG5HoI8E5lWzu_b7WrJ-OIGUEAhcv2IMexnCo6vf36pNNS_1gLD_bwh3=
qzGP7S0AztUehSg/4v7/-OVuV3BVQM6gQF_cbLYnJg/h30/h001.TgaIYOEXFLYF1D43NlTZBYM=
Ydm6Vyt9M03tLyUdUtDA" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Fernandes sulked under his =
club-issue hoodie</a> throughout the game, less a leader of men than a mood=
y teenager with his phone confiscated. With good reason, it turned out; lat=
er on Sunday, Bruno=E2=80=99s official InstaChat account was <a href=3D"htt=
ps://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzSINXrMyEJiuYviYZXN=
Tcg9EjwH9zo8sKUGXWLMZWme1Xnup60UmsnKnardwI1XxrdsjspdfAmKX-yYwWtkEtvIw1iCfe0=
2RzrJcCEHKvWd6dJ-0zEGRcD_MbARGjaOhkvAfcIHYYrMzxlc2-QexxQ-8neZETR5Df37arSGN_=
8SDtp_sbo5CxCj6TAfOwsRIJUjHsCUAH9BV5_HxYfeGx7K5PQks7xSLOoI/4v7/-OVuV3BVQM6g=
QF_cbLYnJg/h31/h001.KreK7H8cDB8eG7cgu3XD3ljBmOw41AXIAv5lEzMklCw" style=3D"c=
olor: #0077B6;">liking a motivational post</a> on the subject of =E2=80=9Cl=
oyal=E2=80=9D people getting =E2=80=9Cpushed to the point where they no lon=
ger care=E2=80=9D. That such things cut both ways has escaped the attention=
 of his social media disgrace team.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Who else was on the list? =E2=80=9CSell th=
e club and **** off home,=E2=80=9D rang out, aimed at the Glazer family and=
 Big Sir Jim Ratcliffe. What sounded like =E2=80=9CJason Wilcox, you=E2=80=
=99re a banker=E2=80=9D was also heard. United fans doubt the credentials o=
f the former Blackburn and Leeds winger and Manchester City backroom staff =
member as a club suit. Alongside Wilcox in the posh seats, Omar Berrada=E2=
=80=99s name was not taken in vain, perhaps mostly because it=E2=80=99s har=
d to scan into contemporary song. Berrada shook his head as Bournemouth sco=
red their second. When =E2=80=9Cbest in class, you=E2=80=99re having a laug=
h=E2=80=9D rang out, they meant you, Omar. Ratcliffe was not present, thoug=
h his biggest brainwave, his master plan for his beloved boyhood club, came=
 into sharp focus. The call from United fans was to =E2=80=9Cstick your new=
 stadium up your ***=E2=80=9D. The weekend saw club members receive a surve=
y, invited to give their thoughts on a design that resembles a circus big t=
op, a truly irresistible metaphor. Presumably, Sunday=E2=80=99s request to =
Big Sir Jim will be filed under =E2=80=9Cother=E2=80=9D in the collation of=
 the survey.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Who=E2=80=99s next? <a href=3D"https://abl=
ink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgsz=
